   },
   {
    "choice": [
     {
      "key": "acc_who_nikolai",
      "auto_rank": 0,
      "do": [
       {
        "say": "narrator",
        "key": "acc_why"
       },
       {
        "choice": [
         {
          "menu": "Two sets. That is not an accusation, that is a Tuesday.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik2_books",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "The real one had her handwriting in the margins. Somebody has been reading it.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik2_second",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "She signed every page. If the pages are wrong, there is exactly one signature on them.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik2_ade",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "She asked me what it costs to leave a place like this. I told her nobody had ever paid it in one go.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik2_offer",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "The bay light is on a timer and it was off. Somebody killed it from inside, and the switch for it is in the mop room.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik2_light",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "key": "acc_back",
          "auto_rank": 1,
          "do": [
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "key": "acc_who_adaeze",
      "auto_rank": 3,
      "do": [
       {
        "say": "narrator",
        "key": "acc_why"
       },
       {
        "choice": [
         {
          "menu": "On every page. That is what a manager is. A person who is on every page.",
          "if_flag": "heard_ade2_sign",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "There was going to be one. She told me. She told me like she was doing me a kindness.",
          "if_flag": "heard_ade2_audit",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "I heard her car. I did not hear it leave. I told myself she was on the phone.",
          "if_flag": "heard_ade2_night",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "You keep saying drowned like the bay explains it. That water is filthy. The only clean basin in this building is the mop room sink and it is deep enough to lose an arm in. I have known that for six years.",
          "if_flag": "heard_ade2_basin",
          "auto_rank": 3,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_clean"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "music": "boss"
           },
           {
            "show": "adaeze",
            "x": 0.72
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:165-171"
           },
           {
            "show": ""
           },
           {
            "cg": "cg_closing"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:174-174"
           },
           {
            "say": "narrator",
            "key": "end_clean_c2"
           },
           {
            "xp": 150
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "I was in there at half past three. I will say that before you find someone who says it for me.",
          "if_flag": "heard_ade2_mop",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "key": "acc_back",
          "auto_rank": 1,
          "do": [
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "key": "acc_who_vee",
      "auto_rank": 0,
      "do": [
       {
        "say": "narrator",
        "key": "acc_why"
       },
       {
        "choice": [
         {
          "menu": "Because everyone else in my life keeps a list, and hers was the only one I wasn't on.",
          "if_flag": "heard_vee2_kind",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "I have a guess. My guess is a man who likes people to owe him something soft.",
          "if_flag": "heard_vee2_paid",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "You think I don't know what you all decided about me. I know.",
          "if_flag": "heard_vee2_cold",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "That it doesn't matter what I did. That there's a shape people have decided I am, and it has a chair in it, and the chair is this one.",
          "if_flag": "heard_vee2_scared",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "I came back for a jacket. Around four. There was a light on in the mop room and I did not go in, and I have been sick about it since.",
          "if_flag": "heard_vee2_seen",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c2_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "precinct"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:205-206"
           },
           {
            "event": "c2_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "key": "acc_back",
          "auto_rank": 1,
          "do": [
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
